  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1707864049_2551038_a93e14978dbfeb797524128cc35d2520.jpg",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">About Alunimyze:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Aluminyze, a leading aluminum printing company dedicated to creating high-quality, environmentally friendly prints. Our journey began 20+ years ago when we began our search to find the highest quality, lux product we could offer to our customers. Aluminum prints were the clear standout. We built state-of-the-art labs and crafted an artisan process that allowed us to be the pioneers in making aluminum available to everyone in a market to which only photo professionals previously had access. Today, we remain at the forefront of industry innovation, guaranteeing unmatched quality and vibrancy that you simply can't find anywhere else. We are proud to say every one of our orders is made with care in the USA.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">As an affiliate partner, you'll receive:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1. Paid Commission:</strong> Earn a generous commission on every sale generated through your unique affiliate link or code. We offer competitive rates to ensure that your efforts are rewarded.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>2. Free Product:</strong> Experience the exceptional quality of our aluminum prints firsthand with a complimentary print of your choice. Showcase it in your content to give your audience a taste of what Aluminyze has to offer.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>3. Exclusive Benefits:</strong> Access to promotional materials, product updates, and ongoing support from our dedicated affiliate team. We're committed to helping you succeed and providing you with everything you need to create compelling content and drive sales.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">If you're interested in joining our affiliate program or would like more information, please reply to this email or visit our <a href=\"https://af.uppromote.com/aluminyze/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">affiliate sign-up page</a>. We'd love to discuss how we can collaborate and support your creative endeavors.</span></p>",
